{"user": "tips for next one?", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T18:35:32.486825+00:00", "assistant": "Tips for the next one:\n\n- **Don\u2019t chase big flips early.** Big flips often give White more moves and easy targets.\n- **Corners are gold**: **a1, h1, a8, h8** can never be flipped.\n- **Avoid \u201ccorner-adjacent\u201d squares** unless the corner is already safe:  \n  - X-squares: **b2, g2, b7, g7**  \n  - C-squares: **a2, b1, g1, h2, a7, b8, g8, h7**\n- **Think mobility**: ask, \u201cAfter my move, how many good moves does White have?\u201d\n- **Edges can be good**, but only if they don\u2019t hand over a corner.\n- **In the endgame, count or preview**: sometimes the best move flips fewer now but wins more discs after the final replies.\n\nSimple rule of thumb: **corners > mobility > safe edges > big flips**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T18:35:33.437219+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T18:35:36.780523+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 2, "Prompt": 2}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["General Principle"], "consensus": ["General Principle"], "votes": {"General Principle": 3, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {